{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52038","headline":"洛水南看汉王马射 · 王绩","name":"洛水南看汉王马射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王马态骄。\n蹀躞过河桥。\n雨息铜街静，尘飞金埒遥。\n铁丝缠箭脚，玉片抱弓腰。\n日□矜百中，唯看杨柳条。\n（以上三十九首均见北京图书馆藏清陈氏晚晴轩抄本五卷本《王无功文集》卷二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}